      "value": "@{66fcdcaf16cec6a6c93c2e47|full_name} Are you still having that? Been happening on my end too for a week now, the same way you described, everyone standing still for some seconds until either I get reconnected again or disconnected with the VRChat is not responding message, or just the Disconnected message. Time varies a lot for that, sometimes every 5 minutes and sometimes 10 or 20 minutes.\n\nI already reset my internet some times, tried both wi-fi and mobile connection through my phone, but still happened the same way.\n\nDoesn't matter what region the instance was created in either.\n\nThis is all my log registers when it happens:\n\n2024.10.17 02:44:55 Error      -  Connection lost. OnStatusChanged to DisconnectByServerTimeout. Client state was: Joined. SCS v0 UDP SocketErrorCode: 0 WinSock\n\n2024.10.17 02:44:55 Log        -  [Behaviour] Disconnected: ServerTimeout with Reason: \n\n2024.10.17 02:44:55 Log        -  [Behaviour] Resetting game flow because \"VRChat is not responding.\": [RejoinInstance, SkipLogin]\n\nAnd a pic attached of that happening that my friend took while I was asleep, ignore the pen writing lol =^=",
